      <h2 id="ncsi-hardware-requirements-for-bare-metal_ipi-install-prerequisites" class="group scroll-mt-20">NC-SI hardware requirements for bare metal<a href="#ncsi-hardware-requirements-for-bare-metal_ipi-install-prerequisites" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
